rent about these things the less  the black boxes and perhaps more  appropriate trust we can build in the  system so whether or not privacy  concerns outweigh the potential research  benefits one thing's for sure this is  just the beginning of companies tapping  into our health data there's gonna be so  much opportunity to make money because  there's so much waste it's three  trillion dollars are spent on health  care every year
 

